<title>POLAND: Mostostal W Q4 net rises to PLN 1.2 mln.</title>
<headline>Mostostal W Q4 net rises to PLN 1.2 mln.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-02-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mostostal Warszawa SA results for the fourth quarter ending December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>						Q4 1996     Q4 1995</p>
<p>    operating profit			1.53  vs    0.07</p>
